  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Heritage Emergency Fund (HEF) is a multi-donor and non-earmarked funding mechanism, established by UNESCO in 2015 with the goal of assisting Member States in preparing and responding to emergencies resulting from armed conflicts and disasters all over the world. It supports emergency preparedness and response activities falling within the domains of the UNESCO Culture Conventions.</narrative>
